</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t4-l-q13\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"E\"></span><span>running very slowly</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":1},{"id":"en-c19-t4-l-g2-2","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 15-18","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>What reason prevented each of the following members of the Compton Park Runners Club from joining until recently?</p><p><i>Write the correct letter,&nbsp;<b>A</b>,&nbsp;<b>B</b>, or&nbsp;<b>C</b>.</i></p><p><b>Reasons</b></p><p><b>Club members</b></p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"matching-dnd-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • <span>Ceri</span><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">15</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t4-l-q15\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • <span>James</span><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">16</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t4-l-q16\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • <span>Leo</span><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">17</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t4-l-q17\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • <span>Mark</span><span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">18</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t4-l-q18\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching\"><div class=\"dnd-panel-instruction\">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div><div class=\"dnd-cards-container\"><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"A\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">A.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">a lack of confidence</spa